WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.150
Monkey D. Luffy is know for humiliating opponents
throughout One Piece.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:07.569
Unless.. he's fighting one of these eleven
characters..

00:00:07.569 --> 00:00:12.759
For someone who is a Shounen protagonist and
should have the thickest plot armour in history,

00:00:12.759 --> 00:00:15.950
Luffy has actually been defeated at least
11 times.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:21.850
One of them is a major surprise, one is almost
as controversial as the zoro vs sanji debate

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:27.199
and the remaining ones all follow the same
4 simple step formula, that make one piece

00:00:27.199 --> 00:00:28.340
so great.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:32.800
Like the time Luffy got defeated and almost
captured by his Arch Nemesis Smoker.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.770
Before even properly starting his adventure,
Luffy traveled to an island called Logue Town,

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:41.570
where Gol D. Roger, the first pirate king,
was both born and ultimately executed.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:46.680
Here, Luffy runs into the marine captain Smoker,
who recognizes him form his first bounty poster

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.579
he just received after beating Arlong.

00:00:48.579 --> 00:00:53.559
Smoker is the first character introduced with
the powers of a Logia Devil fruit power, that

00:00:53.559 --> 00:00:59.510
turns his body into smoke, making him completely
immune to any physical attacks.

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:04.650
As a result, Luffy has no chance at all against
the Marine and is defeated in an instant.

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:09.299
He is only spared because his father Dragon
steps in to stop Smoker.

00:01:09.299 --> 00:01:14.820
As a result, Luffy is able to proceed with
his crew towards the grand line.

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:19.350
The pattern Eiichiro Oda, the author of One
PIece, uses here, are the same 4 steps that

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:23.350
he uses with every single opponent, that is
able to beat Luffy.

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:29.310
He first introduces the villain in an impressive
way, showing how powerful they are and have

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:33.780
them defeat Luffy, in this case Luffy not
landing a single hit on Smoker.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:41.060
In the second step, Luffy barely manages to
escape, like Dragon stepping in to safe his

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:42.060
son.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:47.280
In the third step, this gives Luffy the need
to grow and be creative, either as a person

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:51.140
or in terms of power to overcome this newfound
obstacle.

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:56.810
Here, Luffy learns that he can’t beat every
enemy he faces and that sometimes you have

00:01:56.810 --> 00:01:58.890
to simply run away to come back stronger.

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:05.649
Which leads to step 4, Luffy succeeding in
his mission, like in this case, making it

00:02:05.649 --> 00:02:07.180
to the entrance of the grand line.

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:12.030
You can see the exact same formula with Luffy’s
third major defeat in the story as well, when

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:18.700
he encounters another marine, this time one
of the 3 most powerful marines, the admiral

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:24.920
Aokiji early on in the story, one of the most
powerful characters in the entire story, period.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:30.030
Aokiji, just like Smoker is a Logia fruit
user, who’s entire body is made of Ice and

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:36.170
can’t take physical damage without an ability
called Haki, that Luffy only learns later

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:37.170
on in the story.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:42.209
With Luffy having no way of dealing any damage
to his opponent once again, he is frozen solid

00:02:42.209 --> 00:02:43.330
by Aokiji.

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:44.330
Step number 1.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:48.330
However, as we learn a little bit later in
the story, Aokiji is more of an ally than

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:49.750
an enemy to the straw hat crew.

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:53.720
He just wanted to test Luffy’s resolve and
if he was actually worthy of watching over

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:59.530
Nico Robin, a girl that has been chased her
entire life and that Aokiji had saved as a

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:00.530
kid.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:04.170
Thus, he doesn’t actually capture or kill
Luffy, but spares him.

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:07.360
Which is how Luffy, Step number 2, escapes.

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:11.470
Even though Aokiji tells him that he should
send Nico Robin away, because she will only

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:17.610
bring trouble to him, again this was a test,
Luffy has already accepted her as part of

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:22.820
his family, Step 3, and is able to proceed
towards Water 7 to get his ship fixed.

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:24.140
Step, number 4.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:29.690
And speaking of water seven, Luffy has his
butt kicked by another official from the world

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:35.030
government, the organization that leads the
Marines and rules the world, who want to capture

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:39.390
Nico Robin for her knowledge about the lost
history, they are trying to keep hidden from

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:40.940
everyone.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:44.970
The government agent Lucci has eaten the leopard
devil fruit, that gives him the ability of

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:48.019
the animal plus superhuman strength and endurance.

00:03:48.019 --> 00:03:53.829
The leopards speed combined with the 6 special
techniques known by the the governments top

00:03:53.829 --> 00:03:58.470
agents make him the first opponent in the
story, that Luffy could actually touch in

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:02.670
theory, but who is simply physically too fast
and strong.

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:06.319
As a result Luffy is utterly humiliated in
this fight.

00:04:06.319 --> 00:04:11.250
The difference in power is so bad, that Lucci
has no interest in finishing Luffy off at

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:15.750
all and instead simply tosses him out of the
building before he leaves the island with

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.110
the captured Robin.

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:19.290
Therefore Luffy survives once again.

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:23.979
This time, in order to save his crew member,
he trains hard and develops 2 new techniques

00:04:23.979 --> 00:04:29.710
for his devil fruit, that allow him to defeat
Lucci in one of the best fights of the series.

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:36.020
As a result he ultimately manages to liberate
Robin in my personal favorite moment of the

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:37.020
entire show.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:40.940
Now you might or might not have realized,
that I actually skipped one of Luffy’s major

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:45.050
defeats: Against the Warloard Crocodile during
the Alabasta saga.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:48.640
luffy didn’t just lose once against him,
but actually twice.

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:53.830
Just like Smoker and Aokiji, Crocodile is
a Logia devil fruit user who is made of sand.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:58.830
Thus Luffy’s punches do nothing once again
and he is gruesomely impaled.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:03.350
This time, he only survives thanks to Robin’s
help, who is still an enemy at this point.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:07.900
I hope you see how nicely all of these defeats
are connected.

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:13.490
In this case, simply getting stronger won’t
be enough, so Luffy has to use his creativity

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:14.900
to overcome this enemy.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:20.740
He has figured out that his fist covered in
blood can deal damage to Crocodile, since

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:22.580
sand’s weakness is moisture.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:27.560
So for his rematch he brings a barrel of water
to the fight and manages to take Crocodile

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:28.710
out that way.

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:33.639
That allows him to save the kingdom of Alabasta
and free Nico Robin from her dark past as

00:05:33.639 --> 00:05:34.639
well.

00:05:34.639 --> 00:05:38.169
Dark, like the dwelling place of the 5th character
that managed to defeat Luffy.

00:05:38.169 --> 00:05:42.620
This one might come as a bit of a surprise,
even if you have already watched up to this

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:43.620
point.

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:46.410
I definitely didn’t remember that this happened
at first.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:53.750
On Thriller bark, Luffy faces Gekko Moria,
one of the seven warloards of the sea, that

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:59.139
has the unique ability to steal people’s
shadows and infuse dead objects with them.

00:05:59.139 --> 00:06:03.480
Now this defeat was really sneaky, but as
Luffy and Co were infiltrating the spooky

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:08.960
castle, they got trapped in a room with countless
of Moria’s zombies, who had already managed

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:10.289
to take Zoro’s shadow.

00:06:10.289 --> 00:06:14.711
And while Luffy was facing the Zombie who
now had Zoro’s powers and personality, he

00:06:14.711 --> 00:06:20.620
was overwhelmed by tiny little spider mice
zombies who managed to seal him inside a coffin,

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:26.240
so that Moria could steal his Shadow too and
infuse it into the ancient giant oars.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:33.289
To be fair, it was not exactly a 1v1 in this
case, but Moria’s entire character was centered

00:06:33.289 --> 00:06:39.280
around letting others fight for him, plus
it was his devil fruit ability that took Luffy

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:40.280
out.

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:42.720
Luffy once again managed to escape however.

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:47.880
He infused himself with hundreds of shadows
and becomes nightmare Luffy, still one of

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:53.690
the coolest forms he has ever had in the story,
and manages to take back his shadow and defeat

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:54.690
Moria.

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:55.690
___

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:58.160
But while this defeat might have been the
most surprising Luffy has every experienced,

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:01.240
it is nothing against what happens next.

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:07.710
Travelling from Thriller Bark to Sabaody Archipelago,
Luffy and the crew experience their most crushing

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:08.729
defeat yet.

00:07:08.729 --> 00:07:13.740
He attacks one of the world nobles, the rulers
of the world, who was trying to buy his mermaid

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:16.090
friend Jamee as a slave.

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:23.430
This is the highest crime anyone can commit,
and so the Goverment sends over another one

00:07:23.430 --> 00:07:25.500
of the 3 Marine admirals.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:31.599
This time it’s not Aokiji, but Kizaru, who
ate the light logia fruit, once again making

00:07:31.599 --> 00:07:34.250
him an enemy Luffy can’t beat.

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:39.910
On top of that there is also Kuma and Sentomaru,
who decimate the entire crew.

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:44.930
Luffy doesn’t know yet, that similar to
Aokiji, Kuma actually does this to protect

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:48.430
Luffy and the others from being captured or
killed by Kizaru.

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:52.840
That way Luffy escapes by being teleported
to another island.

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:58.710
However in this case the growth from this
defeat doesn’t happen right away, making

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:01.810
this the curious exception in this list.

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:06.449
Instead, Luffy finds out that his brother
ace has been captured and is about to be executed

00:08:06.449 --> 00:08:07.540
by the Marines.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:12.699
So he goes on a mission to free him from the
hellish government prison impel down.

00:08:12.699 --> 00:08:17.440
The main antagonist here is Maggelan, the
warden of the prison that has eaten the Poison

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:22.150
Poison fruit, that allows him to produce and
manipulate any poison imaginable.

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:27.800
He stands out from this list, as Magellan
not only defeated Luffy without any effort

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:33.789
at all, but also Blackbeard and his entire
crew, as they were infiltrating the prison.

00:08:33.789 --> 00:08:39.919
Luffy only manages to survive his deadly poisoning
thanks to you being subscribed to the channel.

00:08:39.919 --> 00:08:45.200
And also his newly made ally Ivankov, who’s
abilities safe Luffy’s life.

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:50.100
Luffy becomes immune to pretty much all poisons
hereafter and manages to make it out of the

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:56.450
prison and towards Marineford, the Marine’s
headquarters, where his brother had been taken.

00:08:56.450 --> 00:09:01.170
However here at the marine headquarters, amidst
the biggest war in the history of one piece

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:06.910
so far, Luffy experiences the biggest defeat
in the entire story so far, which results

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:11.310
in the lowest point of his journey, to the
point where he almost gives up his will to

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:13.610
live all together.

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:16.230
Luffy isn’t defeated only once during this
war.

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:21.089
He is surrounded by characters way out of
his league, but through sheer will alone and

00:09:21.089 --> 00:09:26.120
with the help of all the new allies he has
made, he manages to free his brother from

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.120
his shackles.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:32.560
However, ultimately, Akainu,t he strongest
and crulest of the 3 admirals, is the one

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:37.160
defeating Luffy here, with his powerful magma
logia abilities.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:43.930
The only reason his life is spared once again,
is because his brother and Jinbei sacrifice

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:44.930
themselves for him.

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:49.000
It is the first and only time so far in the
story, where Luffy doesn’t succeed in his

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.200
mission during an arc.

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:53.470
He wanted to save his brother and failed.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:58.140
Which makes it the most impactful invent of
One PIece to this day.

00:09:58.140 --> 00:10:00.430
However, Luffy did learn from his defeat.

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:04.690
It inspired him to become a better captain
who can properly take care of his crew and

00:10:04.690 --> 00:10:11.130
taught him that you can’t always expect
things to just work out without any consequences.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:16.250
And even better, to give Luffy a major payoff
and win after this gigantic loss, after a

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:21.170
2 year time skip full of trianing and new
abilities, Luffy is not only able to beat

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:26.630
the Pacifista that he had so much trouble
with on Sabaody, but he is now also able to

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:32.810
use Haki, the ability necessary to fight against
Logia type users like Smoker, crocodile or

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:34.670
any of the three admirals.

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:39.470
Which makes the next character that defeats
Luffy just the more surprising.

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:44.760
The crazy scientist Ceasar Clown, who rules
over the apocalyptic island Punk Hazard is

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:46.660
another Logia fruit user.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:49.510
His body is made out of gas.

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:54.529
Luffy is able to survive Ceasar’s inital
poison gas attack, ethically quite questionable

00:10:54.529 --> 00:10:58.190
by the way, thanks to his poison immunity
from the prison.

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:03.100
But then the scientist removes all the air
from the room, since oxygen is also a gas,

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:05.220
and thus makes Luffy pass out.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:06.950
Very clever fighting.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:11.370
Luffy once again manages to get away easily
with the help of his new ally, the warloard

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:12.370
trafalgar law.

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:17.779
Luffy learns from his earlier mistake and
takes out Ceasar in a quite satisfying manner.

00:11:17.779 --> 00:11:23.910
Not as satisfying though as against this next
enemy that managed to defeat Luffy.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:29.990
This is probably the most controversial and
maybe unique candidate on this list.

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:35.250
Charlotte Katakuri is the strongest pirate
in the crew of the emperor Big Mom, one of

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:39.710
the four strongest pirates who rule this part
of the world.

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:44.850
Katakuri has eaten the Mochi Mochi fruit,
Mochi being sticky japanese rice cake.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:50.820
His fruit is pretty much the same as Luffy’s
rubber abilities, only that katakuri is better

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:58.560
at using it, he also has way better Haki abilities
and overall outclasses Luffy by miles.

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:03.709
He completely dominates their fight to such
an extend, that Luffy gets as frustrated as

00:12:03.709 --> 00:12:06.790
we haven’t seen him for a long time in the
story.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:11.899
He escapes in the middle of the battle to
think about his strategy and how he can catch

00:12:11.899 --> 00:12:13.280
up to Katakuri.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:19.260
Katakuri meanwhile starts to like Luffy and
pushes him to grow stronger until he is powerful

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:20.490
enough to defeat him.

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:27.530
There is a very strong argument here whether
or not Katakuri let Luffy beat him voluntarily

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:33.100
or not, but it is without question that Katakuri
beat Luffy during the first half of the fight

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:38.680
and that the battle followed the same 4 stages
as all the other defeats.

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:43.950
Luffy learns to use his devil fruit way more
creatively and even gains the ability to look

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.270
slightly into the future.

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:52.649
But this is nothing against what Luffy learned
from his battle with Kaido, one of the four

00:12:52.649 --> 00:12:57.070
emperors, said to be the strongest creature
on the planet.

00:12:57.070 --> 00:13:02.079
Luffy’s introduction to kaido is a defeat
with a single hit.

00:13:02.079 --> 00:13:05.510
Luffy might never have been as out classed
as in this fight.

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:11.580
He has to go on an entire training arc and
escape from prison in order to take on Kaido

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:12.580
again.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:13.720
And is still beaten a second time.

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:18.589
This time Luffy is saved by his devil fruit
powers and his will to live.

00:13:18.589 --> 00:13:23.410
He grows immensely as both a leader and a
fighter, to the point where he emerges as

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:26.519
one of the strongest people in the story.

00:13:26.519 --> 00:13:31.910
So there really aren’t too many characters
left, who would have a chance of beating luffy.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:34.760
This guys here however is a different story.

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:40.930
Blackbeard is the main antagonist of the story
and will be Luffy’s biggest obstacle in

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:41.930
becoming pirate king.

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:47.370
If you want to know just how powerful he is,
and why he is able to wield 2 devil fruits

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:52.680
at the same time you can watch this video
right here next.

